{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/NVFlare/pulls/5191","id":4335894149,"node_id":"PR_kwDOFy3KIc8AAAABAnB-hQ","html_url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/NVFlare/pull/5191","diff_url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/NVFlare/pull/5191.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/NVFlare/pull/5191.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/NVFlare/issues/5191","number":5191,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Handle unexpected job admission failures","user":{"login":"YuanTingHsieh","id":13113932,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMTEzOTMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13113932?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuanTingHsieh","html_url":"https://github.com/YuanTingHsieh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuanTingHsieh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuanTingHsieh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuanTingHsieh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuanTingHsieh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuanTingHsieh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuanTingHsieh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuanTingHsieh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuanTingHsieh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuanTingHsieh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\n- cancel successful resource reservations when job admission exits unexpectedly\n- record unexpected admission failures in schedule history so retry backoff and maximum-attempt handling remain effective\n- continue scanning later candidates after cleanup succeeds\n- stop the scheduler pass when resource results are unavailable or cancellation fails, because reservation state cannot be proven safe\n- replace the scheduler's bare exception handlers with `except Exception`\n\n## Root cause\n\n`DefaultJobScheduler.schedule_job()` caught exceptions around the complete candidate scan. If `_try_job()` raised after resource reservation, the exception bypassed normal cancellation and scheduling bookkeeping, then aborted the scan before later candidates were considered.\n\n## Implementation\n\n`_try_job()` now owns the reservation lifecycle after resource-check results are returned. Reservations are retained only when the job is admitted successfully; all other exits run cancellation from a `finally` block. Empty results for non-empty client resource requests are treated as unsafe because reservation tokens may have been lost with missing replies.\n\n`_do_schedule_job()` handles unexpected exceptions at the individual-candidate boundary, logs the traceback, records a retryable failed attempt, and proceeds to the next candidate after successful cleanup. Errors that leave reservation state uncertain still abort the pass after bookkeeping.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `30 passed`: `tests/unit_test/app_common/job_schedulers/job_scheduler_test.py`\n- Black check across `nvflare examples tests dev_tools`\n- isort check across `nvflare examples tests dev_tools`\n- Flake8 across `nvflare examples tests dev_tools`: 0 errors\n- agent skill checks: 0 findings","created_at":"2026-08-21T23:29:07Z","updated_at":"2026-08-26T23:20:32Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"2b28a1edff99b8fdf58f897ff1435847b6447a8c","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"pcnudde","id":1881453,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODE0NTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1881453?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcnudde","html_url":"https://github.com/pcnudde","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcnudde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcnudde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcnudde/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcnudde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"h